      "message": "Note: adding the domain scope for the domain role operations here was necessary for the Domain Manager Persona to be able to work with domain roles. This introduces a change in behavior: a domain-scoped admin can now also use these endpoints, which was previously forbidden.\nSince a domain admin has implicitly a higher privilege level than a domain manager, I don\u0027t deem this problematic.",
